From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Martin=20=C5=A0trobl?= <recordyletsplays@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 13:33:25 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Enable mogrify on arm64 build hosts

gen-bootanimation.zip ran the x86-64 linux-x86/bin/mogrify on arm64
hosts ("Exec format error"). Enable the module for arm64 and point the
linux_musl_arm64 target at linux-arm64/bin/mogrify, a static
ImageMagick 6 mogrify (PNG and zlib only, like the x86 one) that
android-host-arm64's setup.sh builds there.
---
 Android.bp | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Android.bp b/Android.bp
index e4b0f2d..dd71868 100644
--- a/Android.bp
+++ b/Android.bp
@@ -24,11 +24,17 @@ prebuilt_build_tool {
         x86_64: {
             enabled: true,
         },
+        arm64: {
+            enabled: true,
+        },
     },
     target: {
         linux: {
             src: "linux-x86/bin/mogrify",
         },
+        linux_musl_arm64: {
+            src: "linux-arm64/bin/mogrify",
+        },
     },
     visibility: ["//vendor:__subpackages__"],
 }
